      "comment": "ELORA DASH (4) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 30.20 beating KING OF CHAOS. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. TWO WHEEL JOHNNY (6) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (30.54) at this track. Should be in this for a long way. KING OF CHAOS (5) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.5 lengths away in second (30.32) behind ELORA DASH at this track. Expected to feature again. SCOTT IMPOSTER (1) has ability and can find the frame.",
